=\"triage\" data-change=\"removed\">ticket</li>\n    <li class=\"diagram-edge\" data-from=\"triage\" data-to=\"macro\" data-change=\"removed\">known</li>\n    <li class=\"diagram-edge\" data-from=\"triage\" data-to=\"fix\" data-tone=\"accent\">handoff</li>\n  </ol>\n</figure>\n","individual":true},{"label":"Swimlane, interactive","html":"<div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 mb-3\">\n  <button class=\"btn\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-size=\"sm\" data-diagram-for=\"dg-swim-live\" data-diagram-action=\"prev\"\n    >Previous</button\n  >\n  <button class=\"btn\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-size=\"sm\" data-diagram-for=\"dg-swim-live\" data-diagram-action=\"next\"\n    >Next</button\n  >\n  <button class=\"btn\" data-variant=\"ghost\" data-size=\"sm\" data-diagram-for=\"dg-swim-live\" data-diagram-action=\"clear\"\n    >Clear</button\n  >\n  <output class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\" data-diagram-for=\"dg-swim-live\"\n    >Click a box or an arrow - or press Next.</output\n  >\n</div>\n<figure\n  class=\"diagram\"\n  id=\"dg-swim-live\"\n  data-interactive\n  data-type=\"swimlane\"\n  aria-label=\"Support escalation across teams\"\n>\n  <figcaption class=\"diagram-caption\">\n    <span class=\"diagram-eyebrow\">Swimlane</span>\n    <span class=\"diagram-title\">A bug report, across four teams</span>\n    <span class=\"diagram-dek\">The handoff into engineering is where the days go.</span>\n  </figcaption>\n  <div\n    class=\"diagram-canvas\"\n    style=\"grid-template-columns: 5.5rem repeat(5, minmax(6.5rem, 1fr)); --diagram-node-w: 7.5rem\"\n  >\n    <div class=\"diagram-group\" data-shape=\"lane\" style=\"--col: 1; --row: 1; --span: 6\"\n      ><span class=\"diagram-group-label\">Customer</span></div\n    >\n    <div class=\"diagram-group\" data-shape=\"lane\" style=\"--col: 1; --row: 2; --span: 6\"\n      ><span class=\"diagram-group-label\">Support</span></div\n    >\n    <div class=\"diagram-group\" data-shape=\"lane\" style=\"--col: 1; --row: 3;